        "id": 62596,
        "name": "Ronway",
        "username": "Ronway",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ronway/{size}/1856_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-05-05T16:58:36.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Something I have learned is that the name of the card, the artwork, and Flavour Text doesn't always have to relate to eachother. The most obvious one I can think of is The Kraken, which shows Tamar being grappled by the Tentacle while the flavour text is Ra. Prophetic may not be her seeing into the future to see Iron Legacy, I almost feel like it is called that to give the players a vision of the future.</p>",
