        "id": 62597,
        "name": "Ironic",
        "username": "Ironic",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/ironic/{size}/2171_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-05-06T19:01:27.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Of course, Visionary also has visions of many timelines she herself has no lived (by way of absorbing memories from her alternate-universe selves). &nbsp;She fought alongside a group called the Freedom Six, but it may or may not have been in Iron Legacy's timeline - indeed, it hard to picture an apocalyptic cold war between the U.S. and Chine in a world which has been united into a single totalitarian state, as is implied in the IL future.</p><p>Ironic</p>",
