      {
        "id": 62599,
        "name": "eggroll20xd6",
        "username": "eggroll20xd6",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/eggroll20xd6/{size}/1993_2.png",
        "created_at": "2013-05-11T16:56:06.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I think the point of that card and of the whole shattered timelines story is that by coming back to the past, Visionary has changed it so that one of multiple timelines is possible. &nbsp;The only thing cannically sound is that Legacy is bound to die at the hands of Baron Blade story wise. &nbsp;Heck, look at the Dreamer. &nbsp;Due to Visionary's interference, the Dreamer was born. &nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>I make a comparison to the recent Mortal Kombat game where Raiden has a vision of the future and believes certain outcomes will result due to certain events. &nbsp;By trying to change the timeline, different heroes fall, old nemesis become allies, and everything changes. &nbsp;Who knows what will happen due to Visionary's interference, but it may all be really bad down the road.</p>",
        "post_number": 5,
        "post_type": 1,
        "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:39:15.536Z",
